            "quote": "Aging is not driven by a single event but results from the synergistic effects of multiple mechanisms, including genetic instability, epigenetic dysregulation, metabolic imbalance, and disrupted cellular stress responses. Oral aging represents a localized manifestation of systemic aging in the oral cavity and acts as a key contributor to the accelerated aging of the whole body. It not only affects local oral homeostasis but also interacts bidirectionally with systemic aging through pathways such as the release of inflammatory mediators.",
